{"strongs": "H1348", "word": "גֵּאוּת", "translit": "ge.ut", "root": "גאות", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "majesty", "definition": "גֵּאוּת noun feminine majesty , Ps 93:1 + 7 t.; — 1. lifting up גֵּאוּת עָשָׁן column of smoke Isa 9:17 גֵּאוּת הַיָּם swelling of the sea Ps 89:10 . 2. majesty of God Ps 93:1 ; Isa 26:10 גֵּאוּת עָשָׂה he hath done majestically Isa 12:5 עֲטֶרֶת גֵּאוּת crown of majesty Isa 28:1 ; Isa 28:3 (Samaria, on a round hill majestically commanding the country). 3. pride דִּבְּרוּ בְגֵאוּת they speak proudly Ps 17:10 so for נְאוֺת Ps 74:20 Bi Che .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1401')\">BDB1401</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1348')\">H1348</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1400')\">BDB1400</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1402')\">BDB1402</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גֵּאוּת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>majesty</highlightword>, <ref ref=\"Ps 93:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,1)\">Ps 93:1</ref> + 7 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>lifting up</highlight> <bdbheb>גֵּאוּת עָשָׁן</bdbheb> <highlight>column of smoke</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 9:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,17)\">Isa 9:17</ref> <bdbheb>גֵּאוּת הַיָּם</bdbheb> <highlight>swelling of the sea</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,10)\">Ps 89:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>majesty</highlight> of God <ref ref=\"Ps 93:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,1)\">Ps 93:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 26:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,10)\">Isa 26:10</ref> <bdbheb>גֵּאוּת עָשָׂה</bdbheb> <highlight>he hath done majestically</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 12:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1